SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The llnn utility is compliant with the IEEE Std 1003.1-2008 (“POSIX.1”)
     specification.

     The flags [--hhnn] are extensions to that specification.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     An llnn utility appeared in Version 1 AT&T UNIX.

CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     Since the _s_o_u_r_c_e file must have its link count incremented, a hard link
     cannot be created to a file which is flagged immutable or append-only
     (see chflags(1)).

